    description: "The alias group used by the tentative return lift (taint._alias_group, PR #2276, WI-zaboh) is loose in three ways:\n1. It joins the right-hand side of a field store: `initCmd.Dir = tmpDir` pulls tmpDir into the group.\n2. It ignores statement order: 3 of the 4 tmate unfollowed escapes sit before the store.\n3. It does not follow a name that comes back from a call (`s := wrap(t)`).\n1 and 2 over-withhold (precision); 3 under-withholds (a confirm can survive).\n\nCLOSE WHEN each has a fixture with the right verdict, or is listed as a stated limit. Evidence fast_smart_test_build_11172026/zaboh/."  # abd3
    fields: {}  # abd3
